# Enter on the date prompt that opened with a block's date keeps the tag as written.
# BUG: a date written with a time, @due({today} 14:00), is rewritten as @due({today}) and the time is lost.
file <<END
- Call @due({today} 14:00)
END
see 󱙬 today
keys md <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
- Call @due({today} 14:00)
END
